# Tool check

This session checks the tools before the real sessions run. Model: `{model}`. Work only inside this folder.

1. Run `node fetch.js https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762 tmp/abs.html`. Note the HTTP status, and find the paper title
   in the saved page.
2. Run `node fetch.js https://arxiv.org/pdf/1706.03762 tmp/paper.pdf`, then
   `pdftotext -enc UTF-8 -l 1 tmp/paper.pdf tmp/paper.txt`. A warning about a MiKTeX log file is harmless. Note the
   first line of `tmp/paper.txt` that contains the word "Attention".
3. Use your web search tool to find the arXiv identifier of the paper "Attention Is All You Need". Note whether the
   search worked.
4. Write `out/smoke.json` with exactly these keys:
   `{"model": "{model}", "abs_status": <number>, "title": "<title>", "pdf_line": "<line>",
   "web_search_ok": <true or false>, "arxiv_id_found": "<identifier or empty>"}`.
5. Delete the files in `tmp/`. Reply with the line `SMOKE DONE`.
